## 🛡️ FIREWALL COVERAGE MATRIX

| Tool Type | Guardian | WorkflowBlocker | TheatricalDetector | SecretDetector | Total |
|-----------|----------|-----------------|---------------------|----------------|-------|
| **write_file** | ✅ BLOCK | ✅ BLOCK | ⚠️ WARN | ⚠️ WARN | 4/4 |
| **read_file** | ✅ BLOCK | - | - | - | 1/4 |
| **run_command** | - | - | ⚠️ WARN | - | 1/4 |
| **search** | ✅ CHECK | - | - | - | 1/4 |

**Legend**:
- ✅ BLOCK = Can block operation
- ⚠️ WARN = Warning only (never blocks)
- ✅ CHECK = Validates parameters
- `-` = Not applicable

